{"id":"vod_sn_37547","vodId":"37547","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"红发少女安妮","name_cn":"红发少女安妮","date":"1979-01-01","year":"1979","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a3146359a745bf730c9153d9b1343a98.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在绿山墙农庄之中，马修和玛丽拉是一对相依为命的兄妹，同时也是农场的主人。随着年岁的增长，每日繁重的农活渐渐令两人力不从心，于是他们决定从孤儿院领养一个男孩来作为他们的继承人。　　然而，孤儿院却在阴差阳错之下将一个名为安妮（小山茉美 配音）的女孩送到了农场，这个女孩有着满脸的雀斑和一头耀眼的红发，非常的夺人眼球。马修是一个沉默寡言的男人，当性格开朗活泼的小安妮走进他的生活后，他渐渐的被快乐所感染。虽然马修很少和安妮讲话，但是他的关心和爱护如同春雨一般润物细无声，默默守护着安妮的成长。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:25","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8BRSsK5m181/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sSVPeL27WC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/3RAV07WQbH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/asmXBptsfP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9eeyEd9S6a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tN7sP6qyXY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/vaV2QAdMUv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yfuApSHjTQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ANZNwkfe7v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hSXpX6tjmW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DnvhqM43hW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/BxDpU7XbmZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/g54bmkP1Xg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7eJW32hzdD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/0